{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Hell \u2013 Chaos by Ricochet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebound Hell</strong> is a minimalist, <strong>top-down action game</strong> where every ball you fire is a <strong>double-edged sword</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a small, square arena. With <strong>each shot</strong>, a white ball is launched. If it hits an enemy, it deals damage. But beware: with <strong>each bounce off a wall, the ball turns red... and can damage you in turn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.poster.avif?t=1772145807\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.webm?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.mp4?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each white bounce has a chance to spawn an enemy around the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies quickly swarm the area, forcing you to <strong>manage your shots intelligently</strong>, or you'll be overwhelmed by your own <strong>ricochets</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 HP. Limited healing. No mercy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.poster.avif?t=1772145807\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.webm?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.mp4?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Upgrade System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 white ball bounces, a <strong>yellow ball is automatically fired</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick it up to trigger a <strong>random upgrade</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.poster.avif?t=1772145807\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.webm?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.mp4?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades That Change <strong>Everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Just Stat Bonuses! Some upgrades completely change how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bomb that explodes red bullets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A radar that slows enemies down.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An hourglass that freezes enemies in time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades react to the number of bullets in play or your movement speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 types of enemies</strong>, from simple magazines to fast-moving, lethal brains, to enemies that transform into obstacles in the arena. Each one adds a <strong>new layer of pressure.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Completely Different Worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Unique Bosses!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.poster.avif?t=1772145807\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.webm?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.mp4?t=1772145807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maximum Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original enemy spawn patterns linked to your own shots.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, <strong>increasing difficulty</strong>: the longer you survive, the denser the chaos becomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique leaderboard that sets you apart from other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ultra-minimalist pixel art style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic, dark electro/synthwave soundtrack that builds in intensity.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3820820/43ba9a5418773d5f8eaa263f2614c7e7afe1396e.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta